<title>PHILIPPINES: Manila mills seek tenders for 25,000T U.S. wheat.</title>
<headline>Manila mills seek tenders for 25,000T U.S. wheat.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two Philippine mills sought tenders on Friday for 25,000 tonnes of U.S. wheat, Manila grains traders said.</p>
<p>Traders said they were invited to submit price quotations for 15,000 tonnes western white wheat and another 10,000 tonnes of dark northern spring wheat at 4 p.m. (0800 GMT) today.</p>
<p>--MANILA NEWSROOM (6 32) 841-8936, FAX 817-6267</p>
